@baseUrl = http://localhost:5131

### Get all shipment items
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/shipmentItems

### Get one shipment item
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/shipmentItems/1

### Create a shipment item
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/shipmentItems
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "Shipment_Id" : 2,
  "Item_Id" : 9,
  "Amout" : 20
}

### Delete a hipment item
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/shipmentItems/2